---
import CommunityLayout from '../components/CommunityLayout.astro';
import ShareButton from '../components/ShareButton';
---

<CommunityLayout
  title="Donate to iDuckConvert: ways to help keep it free"
  description="iDuckConvert is free to use. Share it, send feedback or suggest a converter to help it grow."
  before="Keep it"
  mark="free"
  intro="iDuckConvert costs nothing to use: no sign-up and no watermark. Money is not the only way to help, and these all make a real difference."
>
  <section class="card p-5" aria-labelledby="share">
    <h2 id="share" class="text-2xl font-black tracking-tight">Tell someone</h2>
    <p class="mt-1 text-muted">The best thing you can do is pass it on to a friend, a classmate or a coworker who is wrestling with a file.</p>
    <div class="mt-4"><ShareButton client:load /></div>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="other">
    <h2 id="other" class="text-2xl font-black tracking-tight">Other ways to help</h2>
    <ul class="mt-3 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <li>
        <a href="/feedback/" class="card card-link h-full p-4">
          <span class="text-lg font-black"><span aria-hidden="true">🐞</span> Report a problem</span>
          <span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-muted">Found something that does not work? A short note is enough.</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/request/" class="card card-link h-full p-4">
          <span class="text-lg font-black"><span aria-hidden="true">💡</span> Suggest a converter</span>
          <span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-muted">Tell us what you wish existed. Requests decide what gets built next.</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/roadmap/" class="card card-link h-full p-4">
          <span class="text-lg font-black"><span aria-hidden="true">🗺️</span> See what is coming</span>
          <span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-muted">What is live and what we are thinking about next.</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/about/" class="card card-link h-full p-4">
          <span class="text-lg font-black"><span aria-hidden="true">🦆</span> Learn how it works</span>
          <span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-muted">Who runs it, what it costs, and how your files are handled.</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="card p-5">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-black tracking-tight">Tips</h2>
    <p class="mt-1 text-muted">
      Tips are the only way to support this site: no ads, no paywall and no sign-up. Tips are not open yet. When they are, this page will say so clearly, and nothing is collected before then.
    </p>
  </section>
</CommunityLayout>
